<title>GERMANY: Daimler sees 12 pct return on capital in 2 years.</title>
<headline>Daimler sees 12 pct return on capital in 2 years.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG management board chairman Juergen Schrempp said on Wednesday the industrial group would be able to achieve its stated goal of a 12 percent return on capital employed within two years.</p>
<p>Addressing the company's annual news conference, Schrempp said: &quot;Within the next two years we will be able to hit our profit targets.&quot; He was referring to the 12 percent goal.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
